  font-weight: 800;
  color: var(--oxide);
  letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  /* Two mask layers, intersected: a fixed-seed noise field punching specks out of the
     letters, and a gradient thinning them towards the baseline where wear collects. The
     seed makes the speckle the same pixels forever, which is what a golden needs. */
